<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back at over NZ$7.20/shr.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back at over NZ$7.20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Friday it had acquired 1.5 million ordinary shares on market at between NZ$7.21 and $7.38 during June 12 pursuant to its $1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>It also bought just under 1.5 million shares off-market at $7.205.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
